{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runaway Bride \ud83d\udc70\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\udca8 is a funny arcade escape game</strong> about love, chaos, and sprinting away from the worst wedding ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Rachel \u2014 a proud lesbian who just said \u201cI don\u2019t\u201d at the altar. Now she has one mission: escape in her wedding dress while her entire family chases her through 10 ridiculous levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, dodge, and escape relatives who drag you back to the altar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect keys to unlock the next level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid obstacles and survive increasingly harder challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 levels full of surprises, family drama, and awkward wedding moments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 <strong>What Makes It Special</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every chasing character has a backstory (grandma is faster than she looks)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix of heartfelt themes (courage, self-love) and pure comedy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, simple arcade gameplay with a hilarious wedding twist</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong><br>Runaway Bride combines <strong>runner mechanics with comedy storytelling</strong>. One wrong move, and it\u2019s back to level one \u2014 but every attempt is funnier than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s heartfelt, chaotic, and rebellious \u2014 just like Rachel.<br>Weddings are optional. Running is not.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level 01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2757570/c4f902c507873954aa41e8f5e6da3626522abb7e.jpg"},{"name":"Level 02","path":"https://cdn.akamai.s